    raw_cardinality                    score=0 vector=(5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1)

G. Repo theorem shape
  Equinumerosity-to-usability repair:
    A count-equivalent quotient can transfer a predicate only after attaching
    the smallest deletion/link/embedding/fiber profile that is pure under
    the allowed outer extensions.
  LRC14 use:
    visible Res_27/cardinal shadows are allowed to guide search, but proof
    transfer must live in owner-private deletion, carry cocycle, endpoint
    protector, and bounded proof-obligation embedding profiles.
